na puṇyaṃ na pāpaṃ na saukhyaṃ na duḥkhaṃ
na mantro na tīrthaṃ na vedā na yajñāḥ |

146
01:47:26,700 --> 01:47:54,400
ahaṃ bhojanaṃ naiva bhojyaṃ na bhoktā
cidānandarūpaḥ śivo'haṃ śivo'ham ||

147
01:49:05,000 --> 01:49:22,700
akacaṭatapayādyaiḥ saptabhirvarṇavargair
viracitamukhabāhāpādamadhyākṣirūpā |

148
01:49:22,800 --> 01:49:46,000
sakalajagadadhīśā śāśvatā viśvayoniḥ
vitaratu pariśuddhiṃ cetasaḥ śāradā vaḥ ||

149
01:52:44,700 --> 01:52:53,800
sapta te agne samidhaḥ sapta jihvāḥ
sapta ṛṣayaḥ sapta dhāma priyāṇi |

150
01:52:53,900 --> 01:53:03,600
sapta hotrāḥ saptadhā tvā yajanti
sapta yonīrāpṛṇasva ghṛtena ||

151
02:01:38,200 --> 02:01:59,000
nityānandakarī varābhayakarī saundaryaratnākarī
nirdhūtākhilaghorapāvanakarī pratyakṣamāheśvarī |

152
02:01:59,100 --> 02:02:21,000
prāleyācalavaṃśapāvanakarī kāśīpurādhīśvarī
bhikṣāṃ dehi kṛpāvalambanakarī mātānnapūrṇeśvarī ||

153
02:02:33,800 --> 02:02:57,500
dṛśyādṛśyavibhūtivāhanakarī brahmāṇḍabhāṇḍodarī
līlānāṭakasūtrakhelanakarī vijñānadīpāṅkurī |

154
02:02:57,600 --> 02:03:22,900
śrīviśveśamanaḥprasādanakarī kāśīpurādhīśvarī
bhikṣāṃ dehi kṛpāvalambanakarī mātānnapūrṇeśvarī ||

155
02:03:34,500 --> 02:03:54,000
yogānandakarī ripukṣayakarī dharmaikaniṣṭhākarī
candrārkānalabhāsamānalaharī trailokyarakṣākarī |

156
02:03:54,100 --> 02:04:14,000
sarvaiśvaryakarī tapaḥphalakarī kāśīpurādhīśvarī
bhikṣāṃ dehi kṛpāvalambanakarī mātānnapūrṇeśvarī ||

157
02:04:24,000 --> 02:04:45,000
devī sarvavicitraratnarucirā dākṣāyaṇī sundarī
vāmā svādupayodharā priyakarī saubhāgyamāheśvarī |

158
02:04:45,100 --> 02:05:05,000
bhaktābhīṣṭakarī sadā śubhakarī kāśīpurādhīśvarī
bhikṣāṃ dehi kṛpāvalambanakarī mātānnapūrṇeśvarī ||

159
02:05:12,500 --> 02:05:35,500
urvī sarvajaneśvarī jayakarī mātā kṛpāsāgarī
veṇīnīlasamānakuntaladharī nityānnadāneśvarī |

160
02:05:35,600 --> 02:06:01,500
sākṣānmokṣakarī sadā śubhakarī kāśīpurādhīśvarī
bhikṣāṃ dehi kṛpāvalambanakarī mātānnapūrṇeśvarī ||

161
02:06:41,700 --> 02:06:43,600
svadeśo bhuvanatrayam |

162
02:09:40,500 --> 02:09:56,000
parātmānamekaṃ jagadbījamādyaṃ
nirīhaṃ nirākāramoṅkāravedyam |

163
02:09:56,100 --> 02:10:13,500
yato jāyate pālyate yena viśvaṃ
tamīśaṃ bhaje līyate yatra viśvam ||

164
02:11:14,500 --> 02:11:19,500
nistraiguṇye pathi vicaratāṃ
ko vidhiḥ ko niṣedhaḥ ||

165
02:12:09,500 --> 02:12:20,500
mātā nāsti pitā nāsti
nāsti bandhuḥ sahodaraḥ |

166
02:12:20,600 --> 02:12:31,900
artho nāsti gṛhaṃ nāsti
tasmājjāgrata jāgrata ||

167
02:12:32,700 --> 02:12:38,600
tasmājjāgrata jāgrata ||

168
02:14:03,800 --> 02:14:21,000
tvadanyaḥ pāṇibhyāmabhayavarado daivatagaṇaḥ
tvamekā naivāsi prakaṭitavarābhītyabhinayā |

169
02:14:21,100 --> 02:14:42,000
bhayāttrātuṃ dātuṃ phalamapi ca vāñchāsamadhikaṃ
śaraṇye lokānāṃ tava hi caraṇāveva nipuṇau ||

170
02:19:00,500 --> 02:19:02,900
prāṇo vāva saṃvargaḥ |

171
02:19:10,800 --> 02:19:23,000
prāṇameva vāgapyeti prāṇaṃ cakṣuḥ
prāṇaṃ śrotraṃ prāṇaṃ manaḥ | prāṇo hyevaitānsarvānsaṃvṛṅkte ||

172
02:21:27,200 --> 02:21:28,800
ahaṃ brahmāsmi |

173
02:23:17,600 --> 02:23:33,000
japo jalpaḥ śilpaṃ sakalamapi mudrāviracanā
gatiḥ prādakṣiṇyakramaṇamaśanādyāhutividhiḥ |

174
02:23:33,100 --> 02:23:53,400
praṇāmaḥ saṃveśaḥ sukhamakhilamātmārpaṇadṛśā
saparyāparyāyastava bhavatu yanme vilasitam ||

175
02:30:19,700 --> 02:30:38,000
lalāṭaṃ lāvaṇyadyutivimalamābhāti tava yad
dvitīyaṃ tanmanye makuṭaghaṭitaṃ candraśakalam |

176
02:30:43,800 --> 02:30:56,700
viparyāsanyāsādubhayamapi sambhūya ca mithaḥ
sudhālepasyūtiḥ pariṇamati rākāhimakaraḥ ||

177
02:31:04,000 --> 02:31:21,600
tava stanyaṃ manye dharaṇidharakanye hṛdayataḥ
payaḥpārāvāraḥ parivahati sārasvatamiva |

178
02:31:24,000 --> 02:31:45,000
dayāvatyā dattaṃ draviḍaśiśurāsvādya tava yat
kavīnāṃ prauḍhānāmajani kamanīyaḥ kavayitā ||

179
02:31:55,400 --> 02:31:58,000
uttiṣṭhata | jāgrata |

180
02:32:30,000 --> 02:32:42,100
etamannamayamātmānamupasaṃkramya |
etaṃ prāṇamayamātmānamupasaṃkramya |

181
02:32:42,200 --> 02:32:47,600
etaṃ manomayamātmānamupasaṃkramya |

182
02:32:47,700 --> 02:32:54,500
etaṃ vijñānamayamātmānamupasaṃkramya |
etamānandamayamātmānamupasaṃkramya |

183
02:34:32,500 --> 02:34:43,000
īśvarānugrahādeva
puṃsāmadvaitavāsanā |

184
02:37:25,800 --> 02:37:35,000
buddhyā viśuddhayā yukto
dhṛtyātmānaṃ niyamya ca |

185
02:37:35,100 --> 02:37:46,800
śabdādīnviṣayāṃstyaktvā
rāgadveṣau vyudasya ca ||

186
02:37:46,900 --> 02:38:04,900
asaktabuddhiḥ sarvatra jitātmā vigataspṛhaḥ |
naiṣkarmyasiddhiṃ paramāṃ saṃnyāsenādhigacchati ||

187
02:38:05,000 --> 02:38:22,100
ahaṅkāraṃ balaṃ darpaṃ kāmaṃ krodhaṃ parigraham |
vimucya nirmamaḥ śānto brahmabhūyāya kalpate ||

188
02:38:56,400 --> 02:39:04,600
ākāśātpatitaṃ toyaṃ
sāgaraṃ pratigacchati |

189
02:39:04,700 --> 02:39:17,000
ākāśātpatitaṃ toyaṃ
sāgaraṃ pratigacchati |

190
02:39:21,500 --> 02:39:39,300
oṃ pūrṇamadaḥ pūrṇamidaṃ
pūrṇātpūrṇamudacyate |

191
02:39:39,400 --> 02:39:48,000
pūrṇasya pūrṇamādāya
pūrṇamevāvaśiṣyate ||
